@startuml
[*] --> Task Created
Task Created --> Categorized as Urgent : System categorizes task
Task Created --> Categorized as Non-Urgent : System categorizes task
Task Created --> Categorized as Pending : System categorizes task

Categorized as Urgent --> In Progress : User starts task
Categorized as Urgent --> Completed : Task completed automatically

Categorized as Non-Urgent --> In Progress : User starts task
Categorized as Non-Urgent --> Completed : Task completed automatically

Categorized as Pending --> In Progress : User starts task
Categorized as Pending --> Completed : Task completed automatically

In Progress --> Pending : Task paused
In Progress --> Completed : Task completed

Completed --> [*]
@enduml
